{{!-- RESERVED NAME: Ghost renders this from the {{navigation}} helper, never
     from {{> navigation}}.

     It emits only the <li> items so the parent <ul> decides the shape — that
     is what lets one partial serve the header, the footer and a mobile sheet.

     `aria-current="page"` rather than a class: the CSS keys off the same
     attribute a screen reader announces, so the highlighted item and the
     announced item cannot drift apart. See abstract/02. --}}
{{#foreach navigation}}
  <li><a href="{{url absolute="true"}}"{{#if current}} aria-current="page"{{/if}}>{{label}}</a></li>
{{/foreach}}
